            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A user terminal, when using a high frequency band having a frequency higher than a certain frequency band including one or a plurality of frequency ranges, increases number of symbols constituting one slot. The user terminal transmits and receives signals by using the slot with the increased number of symbols.</p>
